mula related productivity +35%"}],"modules":[],"review":{"official":"Born in Londinium in\nVictoria\n, Lava is the younger twin sister of her fellow\nOperator\n,\nHibiscus\n. After contracting\nOripathy\n, she came to\nRhodes Island\nfor treatment. She found the idea of saving lives appealing, and so volunteered for training.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":40,"base":{"hp":614,"atk":321,"def":41,"res":10,"redeploy":70,"dp":27,"block":1,"interval":2.9},"max":{"hp":878,"atk":453,"def":69,"res":10,"redeploy":70,"dp":27,"block":1,"interval":2.9},"rangeId":"2-3"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":55,"base":{"hp":878,"atk":453,"def":69,"res":15,"redeploy":70,"dp":30,"block":1,"interval":2.9},"max":{"hp":1141,"atk":582,"def":95,"res":15,"redeploy":70,"dp":30,"block":1,"interval":2.9},"rangeId":"3-6"}],"trust":{"hp":0,"atk":60,"def":0}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging tests have shown the outlines of her internal organs to be indistinct due to abnormal shadows. Originium granules have been detected in her circulatory system, confirming her to be infected with Oripathy.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 9.4%\nShe presents no obvious external symptoms of Oripathy.\n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.25 u/L\nDegree of infection is minor and has not had any physical impact."},{"section":"Originium Arts Rating","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"Under the guidance of her Originium Arts instructor, Lava learned how to control basic Arts in less than a month despite never touching Originium before. Her methods are still rudimentary, and at present she can still only use simple flame conversions, but her stability and learning speed are astounding. If she trains for a long period of time, she may be able to reach a very high level."},{"section":"Ar